Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 07:31:55 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] feat(platform): Provider.Begin, Op audit, technical
 log, events (ADR-0026)

Permission and cluster ownership are checked before any read, scope comes from the catalog, Op.Require re-checks, Op.Audit keeps content out, Op.End writes the technical journal and metrics, Op.Notify is addressed through the Env.

Signed-off-by: Vadim <vmilyash@mts.ru>
